[{"title":"三江","author":"释函是","text":"乘风昨夜扣山窗，惭愧华亭尚隔江。\n莫道骊珠容易见，乖龙左耳割难降。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45264,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四支","author":"释函是","text":"漠漠同云向夕垂，千门万户锁寒炊。\n落花一片能潜化，何况芳林绝路岐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45265,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五微","author":"释函是","text":"堆压横桥山径微，寒林霁色一僧归。\n閒杀五陵贵公子，醉骑白马去如飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45266,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六鱼","author":"释函是","text":"鸿飞不到百情疏，阻阔江山烟雾馀。\n飘落尽归寒没处，暮林空见野人庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45267,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七虞","author":"释函是","text":"松根一夜拨红炉，浇尽秦灰入玉壶。\n万古江山只若此，琼楼歌暖漫呼卢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45268,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八齐","author":"释函是","text":"崩腾未可凌高岳，缭绕还堪隐别蹊。\n一望风烟迷古洞，长安争似晚峰西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45269,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九佳","author":"释函是","text":"平沈山岳影参差，深夜同谁步玉街。\n万丈光寒看璨瑳，回头人自隔天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45270,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十灰","author":"释函是","text":"谁催千里集瑶台，朔气萧萧映玉杯。\n销尽岂如随雾转，有时飘坠碧崔嵬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45271,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一真","author":"释函是","text":"皎皎轻飘桂叶春，影娥池畔趁芳辰。\n凌空更上无栖处，却笑人间醉玉尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45272,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二文","author":"释函是","text":"日暮惊沙薄楚云，云中江树影纷纷。\n香炉飞瀑三千尺，犹较衡阳白雁群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45273,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三元","author":"释函是","text":"黄云白日暗寒原，鸿雁无声度塞垣。\n自古客行愁道远，纷纷薄木锁侯门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45274,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四寒","author":"释函是","text":"千骑猎马出楼兰，不见飞禽落日寒。\n风起平沙天路白，角声吹入朔云团。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45275,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五删","author":"释函是","text":"莫愁残腊满头斑，绛色偏能驻老颜。\n更有销寒誇玉马，定教丹石胜常山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45276,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一先","author":"释函是","text":"新住寒山绿玉川，连光晓映卜丰年。\n已堆万户千重璧，谁靳沿门一个钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45277,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二箫","author":"释函是","text":"筛空万里不封条，未到春林惨气销。\n谁道凝阴能掩素，瑶花偏逐朔风飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45278,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三肴","author":"释函是","text":"千山寒落荫重茅，拟作明珠误水泡。\n一任晓风惊复息，不教残冻挂空梢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45279,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四豪","author":"释函是","text":"练丝千缕何劳泣，逵路茫茫真欲号。\n拚教寂寞山头望，不是扬雄谁载醪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45280,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五歌","author":"释函是","text":"眼前浩洁凌晨早，倾耳希声清夜多。\n渐入春郊花气暖，寒庭谁解泣铜驼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45281,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六麻","author":"释函是","text":"破衲蒙头老岁华，寒深时亦动长嗟。\n古来甲子朝门外，亦有幽兰哀日斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45282,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七阳","author":"释函是","text":"寝迹穷年乐未央，万山璀璨引风长。\n听残檐溜添寒絮，不卧仙人白玉床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45283,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八庚","author":"释函是","text":"凛栗忽惊溪路明，峨峨千里共云平。\n藐姑山里知何似，寒夜相逢莫问名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45284,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九青","author":"释函是","text":"白尽千峰峰顶青，空濛之内有人醒。\n寒飙忽起从空下，不信瑶华满夜庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45285,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十蒸","author":"释函是","text":"因高累仞看容易，息影凭空力不胜。\n荒月自来还自去，更无人待碧崚嶒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45286,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一尤","author":"释函是","text":"琉璃殿里汎虚舟，光涌层波天际浮。\n深夜冷然照墙壁，忽疑身在碧云头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45287,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二侵","author":"释函是","text":"寒飘玉蕊散高林，弱木颓枝冻已深。\n更向陌头云里望，岂堪凄切暮猿心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45288,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三覃","author":"释函是","text":"环丘山上覆冰蚕，作茧丝成五彩函。\n若使海人献巢许，不将霜质伴华簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45289,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四盐","author":"释函是","text":"遥空直下水晶帘，照见鲛人夜织缣。\n无端一阵寒风急，吹落纨丝散作盐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45290,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五咸","author":"释函是","text":"栖老云中碧玉岩，经春犹自托松杉。\n人间未必能知此，遮莫临风寄素缄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45291,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山谣","author":"释函可","text":"一尺土，一寸膏。\n膏夜流，土生涛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45292,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"神谣","author":"释函可","text":"人肉馨，神眼睁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45293,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"多多谣","author":"释函可","text":"灵蛇头，觔竹袖。\n皇英韨，多多有。\n千年龟，张大口。\n燕支税，多多有。\n锦牛驼，银狮吼。\n死人汁，多多有。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45294,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"耿耿二章","author":"释函可","text":"耿耿双瞳，游于面间。\n瞩人则易，瞩己则难。\n勿谓无非，无非非至。\n勿谓无知，人将瞩尔。\n己非毋匿，人非毋刻。\n躬厚薄责，大人之特。\n突如其来，突如其已。\n念生无根，与物为至。\n纷纭不辍，毋用遏绝。\n知幻即离，空明如月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45295,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜得孙 其一","author":"康麟","text":"乔木阴连屋，溪山旧相儒。\n昨辞天上禄，今得掌中珠。\n种德惟桑梓，传家只典谟。\n善缘天不负，阴骘本无拘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45296,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佛不在木一章章十句","author":"释函可","text":"佛不在木，念不在珠。\n绵绵不断，无欠无馀。\n厥色维紫，厥质维樗。\n渠今即我，我不是渠。\n永言数之，渠我如如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45297,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山鬼四章章四句","author":"释函可","text":"明月在天，塔影在地。\n北风凄凄，惟吾与尔。\n塔影在地，明月在天。\n汝不我处，人谁汝怜。\n汝惟一舌，我惟一脚。\n我啸汝歌，汝歌我跃。\n天地草草，山河落落。\n霜老星残，云胡不乐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45298,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜得孙 其二","author":"康麟","text":"龙江佳丽地，绿水绕青山。\n秀挺蟾宫桂，香生谢砌兰。\n伏犀丹顶出，新月两眉弯。\n况有诗书泽，家家学孔颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45299,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"思亲","author":"康麟","text":"亲舍迢迢久别离，客边无日不兴思。\n西风孤馆闻蛩处，疏雨残灯听漏时。\n上国霜寒鸳被薄，大江天远雁书迟。\n白云望断空翘首，彩服何年献书卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45300,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆弟凤龙","author":"康麟","text":"京华作客又三年，骨肉分携各一天。\n亲舍有云空自望，乡书无雁倩谁传。\n谢池草长春多梦，姜被寒生夜不眠。\n自是欲归归未得，月明千里寸心悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45301,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乐神辞三章 其一","author":"释函可","text":"星为马兮云为辔，生为忠兮死为厉。\n草有子兮山有麂，腰铁铃兮冠雉尾。\n击鼓其镗兮回瞋作喜，琉璃堂兮血食斯地。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45302,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乐神辞三章 其二","author":"释函可","text":"儿孙为田兮魂魄为粮，神年丰兮国为良。\n银者白兮金者黄，以赎命兮身面光，一人安居兮保边疆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45303,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乐神辞三章 其三","author":"释函可","text":"黑云压兮金乌藏，鼓声死兮剑无芒。\n血为碧兮骨为霜，五陵墟兮万井荒。\n笔墨精兮职为郎，翠钿委地魂魄芳。\n日吉兮时良，陈列兮馨香，马有湩兮豕有肠。\n舞窈窕兮歌琳琅，明星烂兮乐未央。\n曰既醉兮云路倘佯，毋厄兹土兮福祚长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45304,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枯鱼过河泣 其一","author":"释函可","text":"枯鱼过河泣，劝鱼且莫泣，劝鱼且莫悲。\n蛟龙有时斩，何况鲂与鲵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45305,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枯鱼过河泣 其二","author":"释函可","text":"枯鱼过河泣，劝鱼且莫泣，劝鱼且莫悲。\n若能一滴水，扬鬣还天池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45306,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"善哉行 其一","author":"释函可","text":"日月烛照，民多纰缪。\n川岳流峙，民用搆斗。\n揖让在前，征诛在后。\n世无伯夷，刬薇种豆。\n匪知何寇，匪庸何富。\n冯道登仙，云中稽首。\n白凤就烹，素麟出走。\n载沉载浮，以永厥寿。\n稼穑既教，生乃弗谷。\n百草既尝，疾乃弗救。\n星斗在胸，江河在口。\n松柏丸丸，斧斤祇候。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45307,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"善哉行 其二","author":"释函可","text":"南有佳人，颜色静好。\n爱而不见，郁我怀抱。\n昨日犹壮，今日已老。\n何以却之，出门刈稻。\n心洞雨晴，目开天扫。\n悠哉悠哉，孰知大道。\n仰掇玄露，俯拾瑶草。\n薄言置之，无求是宝。\n树下一宿，日中一饱。\n古之圣贤，无他谬巧。\n众荣亦荣，众槁亦槁。\n瞻彼蚩蚩，惄焉如捣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45308,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"短歌行","author":"释函可","text":"前后左右，四面八方。\n忧愁骈集，我何可当。\n欲寄天上，虑天弗禁。\n欲埋地下，恐地将沉。\n不如收拾，置我怀抱。\n寝之食之，于焉终老。\n沧海何阔，蓬莱何高。\n世无黄鹄，乘我游翱。\n古之侠士，尘视生死。\n凡今之人，畏首畏尾。\n好谋弗终，时命终穷。\n东南失利，西北多凶。\n黄沙为棺，白云为椁。\n我则如是，千秋寥落。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45309,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长歌行","author":"释函可","text":"我歌我歌，旧民犹可，新民奈何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45310,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"薤露歌","author":"释函可","text":"薤上露，畏白日，日出露乾无遗迹。\n古今杳杳无消息，宝马空嘶垄树直。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45311,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蒿里曲","author":"释函可","text":"蒿里谁家地，日夕悲风起。\n命尽五更头，不到五更尾。\n狐狸招手人不知，脚下黄泉尺有咫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45312,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋思","author":"释函可","text":"鸿雁逐飞云，青天亦有行。\n兄弟本四人，仲季歘云亡。\n伯窜东海隅，叔留南海旁。\n相隔万馀里，东南永相望。\n忆昔在长安，膝下共两双。\n朝去候门扉，朝回牵衣裳。\n忆昔在南国，齐揖事先王。\n教训日以严，道义日以康。\n忆昔在家园，气力各自强。\n读书穷壶兴，落笔竞沅湘。\n神异古人遇，举世无文章。\n当春二三月，风吹百草长。\n登堂献寿酒，散步陟崇冈。\n夏日听黄鹂，阴阴亭馆凉。\n折荷绿玉池，剥荔黄金床。\n桐叶下金井，四围橘柚黄。\n薄暮向空阶，联袂延月光。\n忽见梅花发，大开楼上窗。\n色映枝枝玉，诗成字字香。\n好景必同赏，佳酿必同尝。\n夜寒必同被，得句必同商。\n先子忽见背，血泪尽汪洋。\n三载草土中，不离阿母傍。\n伯也忽瞿然，团圞非久长。\n拜母别诸弟，薙发栖大匡。\n仲弟登贤书，云路步前芳。\n叔弟薄青衿，欣然慕老庞。\n阿季独俶傥，走马少年场。\n抱志虽各殊，骨肉不相忘。\n一朝日月坠，大地共仓皇。\n紫荆长枝折，飘零天一方。\n寄书阻兵革，得罪饱冰霜。\n远碛听笳吹，回头盼故乡。\n前月片纸来，摧胸裂肝肠。\n闾井十无一，举家惨罹殃。\n叔弟尚伏枕，一命在微茫。\n母死恐未葬，弟死谁盖藏。\n登山苦无梯，涉河苦无梁。\n山木何翛翛，河水何汤汤。\n安得高飞翼，驾我以翱翔。\n狂雨日下来，白昼黑淋浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45313,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋思曲","author":"释函可","text":"山峨峨兮水盘盘，念佳期兮秋月圆。\n揽衣视夜兮风雨迎门，彼美人兮梅一村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45314,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"静夜吟 其一","author":"释函可","text":"秋夜如漆我心忧，醒亦忧，寐亦忧。\n兼之蟋蟀，苦鸣不休。\n揽衣忽坐起，还卧泪横流。\n大风吹树何飕飗，床头书鬼声啾啾。\n家乡已荡尽，胡为身独留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45315,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"静夜吟 其二","author":"释函可","text":"我有一点心，暗风吹已碎。\n一半福州山，一半浔江水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45316,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少年行","author":"释函可","text":"红日射高楼，歌声不肯休。\n借问北邙山，几人曾白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45317,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞下曲","author":"释函可","text":"日落雁声急，萧条人独行。\n偶看原上草，偏动黍离情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45318,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临高台 其一","author":"释函可","text":"临高台，望行尘。\n多少驱车向西去，曾无一个是新人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45319,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临高台 其二","author":"释函可","text":"临高台，望东海。\n海上潮回自有时，流民东来无返期。\n愿平高台塞东海，毋使流民心骨碎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45320,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相逢行 其一","author":"释函可","text":"相逢路多岐，君东我自西。\n莫问名和姓，回头知是谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45321,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相逢行 其二","author":"释函可","text":"相逢大路侧，君南我自北。\n袖里无黄金，终是不相识。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45322,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相逢行 其三","author":"释函可","text":"相逢大路中，君西我自东。\n不知为何事，但见马匆匆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45323,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相逢行 其四","author":"释函可","text":"相逢两复三，君北我自南。\n明知不是伴，半揖略交谈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45324,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"空城雀","author":"释函可","text":"空城雀，腹中饥。\n雀虽饥，无是非，莫向上林枝上栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45325,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"君马黄","author":"释函可","text":"君马黄，四足忙，挥鞭意气何扬扬。\n我独无马步道旁，我步踯躅君马狂。\n下有不测之大堑，上有崎岖百折之崇冈。\n万一失足，人马皆亡。\n愿君下马为君指，林间有路平且康。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45326,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长相思 其一","author":"释函可","text":"长相思，来何迟。\n荆山鼎就紫清归，六宫粉黛化作泥。\n王母高居在瑶池，无数仙人进玉饴。\n千秋万岁以为期，何不驾六龙中天飞。\n青鸟衔书到海涯，杲杲出日，浮云蔽之。\n长相思，不可知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45327,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长相思 其二","author":"释函可","text":"长相思，暗泪披。\n虫吟草根如知之，夜深佛火光希微。\n钟鼓不鸣心肝摧，白云一片何处栖，故园紫荆馀枯枝。\n长相思，见何时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45328,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长相思 其三","author":"释函可","text":"长相思，在上古。\n神农虞夏皆黄土，手把黄土心欲诉。\n黄土乌知予心苦，向空一掷散如雾。\n天无门兮地无路，龙为鱼兮鼠为虎。\n愿还苍生置三五，四海欣欣歌且舞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45329,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关山月 其一","author":"释函可","text":"月向巫闾山上出，不照人间照死骨。\n死骨千年更不还，魂随山月度重关。\n关山叠叠归魂苦，苍茫不记来时路。\n闺中少妇独夜眠，心心嘱梦去寒边。\n梦去魂归不得遇，明月如霜草虫语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45330,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关山月 其二","author":"释函可","text":"关山月，何惨悽。\n城上吹笛乌复啼，城下秋草白萋萋。\n安得长风吹此月，直向石洞青松枝。\n关山月，无尽时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45331,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"来日大难","author":"释函可","text":"来日大难，风雨在门。\n今日有客，且共盘桓。\n精卫衔木，东海必填。\n匹夫立志，金石匪坚。\n葛洪熟识，贻我大丹。\n不愿长久，顾世多艰。\n白雪充腹，敝絮遮寒。\n咄咄罪夫，在天地间。\n冥冥何用，栖栖亦戆。\n沮溺弗为，何况孔孟。\n朝歌亦入，盗泉亦饮。\n下士笑之，上士同哂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45332,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有所思","author":"释函可","text":"有所思，乃在村头三五树。\n树上啁啾翠羽鸣，树下美人向空语。\n此时山月定得闻，似解不解无伦绪。\n一撚愁心到夜阑，凭谁寄与长边戍，山月似归天上去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45333,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]